OL,3,GNEWSACombined authority faces fresh
OL,4,Agovernment probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mayoral authority is to face a new
OL,7,Fgovernment inspection into its
OL,8,Ffinances.
OL,10,FLocal government minister Jim McMahon
OL,11,Fsaid he had "material concerns" about
OL,12,Fthe "long-term financial
OL,13,Fsustainability" of Tees Valley Combined
OL,14,FAuthority (TVCA).
OL,16,FThe body, led by Conservative mayor Ben
OL,17,FHouchen, has been under a Best Value
OL,18,FNotice (BVN) for the past 18 months.
OL,19,FThe North East's six Labour MPs said in
OL,20,Fa statement this inspection was an
OL,21,F"escalation" of the BVN and the probe's
OL,22,Ffindings were due in March.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
